# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — MODEL_master (repo cosmos-design, PUBLIC)
# Rule (Gabriel, 2026-09-26): git holds only the numbered, ordered,
# LLM-ready corpus files + the site. Everything else stays local
# (verbatims, sessions, sources, manifests, changelogs, notes, archives).
# Implemented as a whitelist: ignore everything at the root, re-include.
# =============================================================================

# --- Root: ignore all, then re-include ---
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/VERSIONS.md
!/docs/
!/V1/
!/V2/
!/V3/
!/tools/
# _prive/ : full canonical corpus, verbatims, sessions, sources — never versioned

# --- V1 and V2: numbered corpus files only ---
/V1/*
!/V1/[0-9][0-9]_*.md
/V2/*
!/V2/[0-9][0-9]_*.md

# --- V3: GENERATED by tools/publier.py from _prive/V3 (verbatims removed) ---
/V3/.genere
/V3/*
!/V3/[0-9][0-9]_*.md
/V3/00_README_V3_HISTORIQUE_*.md
# Verbatims chapters: kept local, author supervision only
/V3/09_VERBATIMS_ET_CONCLUSIONS_POUR_CALCUL.md
/V3/18_GUIDE_RELECTURE_VERBATIMS.md
!/V3/README.md
!/V3/V3_4dfx_FORMALISATION_LEPTONS.md
!/V3/calculs/
!/V3/visuels/
/V3/visuels/JOURNAL_REVISION_VISUELLE.md
/V3/visuels/PROMPTS_VISUELS_V3.md

# --- Site (docs/) ---
docs/**/standalone_*.html
docs/READO/
docs/univers/images/V2-*-archive-*.png
docs/univers/images/EXPLO-*.png

# --- OS / editors / Python / logs (anywhere) ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
*.log
node_modules/
*.zip
!docs/univers/downloads/*.zip
